ind":"announcement","title":"Developer Plays","summary":"This gameplay is a failed challenge, almost at the end I picked the wrong peg and messed up my board, so failed to finish... I hope you all like it, please try the demo yourself and wishlist the game if you like it.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:30:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692173","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5073610-1846651706687700","game_id":"steam-5073610","kind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update","summary":"Hello Everyone,We were looking for your feedbacks and concerns, so we decided to change a few things. First of all the design: it's now an acrylic painted base design with painted characters, but we decided to keep the 3D talking heads for better user experience, this might change later.New shorter communication and messages are also updated, the devil talks less. The UI also had a huge update with unified new UI elements! The settings menu has more detailed setting options now.We're ready for t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T18:19:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687700","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5073610-1840944183787335","game_id":"steam-5073610","kind":"announcement","title":"Pegs of Hell Demo is available now","summary":"So. You have found the door with no price on it.That is deliberate. The house does not charge for the first hour. It charges for the last one.The demo for \\Pegs of Hell\\ is out now, and it is free in the way that first drinks are free.What is behind the doorThe Induction. Eight short chapters where I explain the rules across a tabl